cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this protocol or software, please cite it as below."
title: "scientific-research-scaffold: a protocol for studies and simulators across repositories"
abstract: >-
  A protocol for laying out research across repositories, in two kinds: a study (one question, with
  versioned exploratory apps, simulators and preregistered experiments) and a sim (one simulator under
  adaptive preregistration). Findings go to one shared research corpus, referenced by claim ID. Includes
  scaffold, a CLI that creates repos in this shape and checks existing ones against it.
type: software
